  "extraction_notes": [
    "Datasheet title is ZXMN2A01F; ordering code ZXMN2A01FTA is listed on p. 1.",
    "No typical or maximum VGS(th) value is published; only the MIN value 0.7 V is transcribed.",
    "RDS(on) publishes two MAX rows: 0.12 ohm at VGS = 4.5 V, ID = 4 A and 0.225 ohm at VGS = 2.5 V, ID = 1.5 A. No typical RDS(on) table values are published.",
    "The RDS(on) table rows are measured under pulsed conditions, width = 300 us and duty cycle <= 2 percent, as stated in Note 8 on p. 3.",
    "VSD also has a MAX value of 0.95 V at VGS = 0 V and IS = 3.2 A; the schema body_diode field records the published TYP value 0.85 V.",
    "IDSS MAX is 1 uA at VDS = 20 V and VGS = 0 V. IGSS MAX is 100 nA at VGS = +/-12 V and VDS = 0 V.",
    "Gate-charge table values are Qg TYP = 3.0 nC, Qgs TYP = 0.8 nC, and Qgd TYP = 1.0 nC at VDS = 10 V, VGS = 10 V, ID = 4 A. The gate-charge figure is included as a curve.",
    "Reverse recovery values are trr TYP = 23 ns and Qrr TYP = 5.65 nC at TJ = 25 degC, IF = 4 A, di/dt = 100 A/us.",
    "Forward transconductance gFS TYP is 6.1 S at VDS = 10 V and ID = 4 A.",
    "Thermal table publishes RthetaJA MAX = 200 degC/W for a 25 mm x 25 mm FR-4 PCB in still air and 155 degC/W for surface-mounted FR-4 measured at t <= 5 s; no RthetaJC is published.",
    "All curve points are direct readings from the clearly labelled manufacturer datasheet plots; no points were interpolated or fitted."
